1
00:01:05,300 --> 00:01:08,940
=When the Lights Rise=
=Episode 5=

2
00:01:09,340 --> 00:01:12,540
Let go of me! I want to find him.

3
00:01:14,460 --> 00:01:14,940
I don't want to.

4
00:01:14,940 --> 00:01:15,340
Get inside.

5
00:01:15,790 --> 00:01:16,620
I don't want to.

6
00:01:16,910 --> 00:01:17,300
Get inside.

7
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:19,220
What right do you have to lock me up?

8
00:01:19,220 --> 00:01:20,260
I'm not a criminal.

9
00:01:20,260 --> 00:01:21,620
Why are you locking me up?

10
00:01:21,620 --> 00:01:22,740
Listen to me, Ding Yiyi.

11
00:01:22,940 --> 00:01:23,660
From now on,

12
00:01:23,660 --> 00:01:25,460
you're not allowed to leave this room.

13
00:01:26,460 --> 00:01:27,300
Ding Zhao.

14
00:01:27,820 --> 00:01:29,020
You can control her for a day or two,

15
00:01:29,020 --> 00:01:29,860
but can you control her forever?

16
00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:30,860
Ding Yiyi.

17
00:01:30,860 --> 00:01:32,140
She'll have to get married eventually.

18
00:01:32,380 --> 00:01:33,340
If there's no other way,

19
00:01:33,340 --> 00:01:34,420
we'll leave Shanghai together.

20
00:01:34,420 --> 00:01:36,020
I don't want to leave Shanghai.

21
00:01:36,020 --> 00:01:37,020
I want to find him.

22
00:01:37,020 --> 00:01:38,100
I love him.

23
00:01:38,260 --> 00:01:39,060
Ding Yiyi.

24
00:01:39,860 --> 00:01:41,300
I'm just reminding you.

25
00:01:41,740 --> 00:01:42,740
Two ordinary students.

26
00:01:43,580 --> 00:01:44,540
One is dead,

27
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:46,580
but the other is still alive.

28
00:01:46,580 --> 00:01:47,620
I don't want to leave Shanghai.

29
00:01:47,620 --> 00:01:49,620
I'm going to his house to find him.

30
00:01:49,980 --> 00:01:50,780
At Yiyi's age,

31
00:01:50,780 --> 00:01:52,140
she should have been married by now.

32
00:01:52,260 --> 00:01:53,260
Marry a rich man
and become his concubine.

33
00:01:53,260 --> 00:01:54,420
Uncle, stay out of this.

34
00:01:54,940 --> 00:01:56,060
What's wrong with that?

35
00:01:56,100 --> 00:01:56,900
Mr. Ding.

36
00:01:57,540 --> 00:01:58,460
I need to ask your sister something.

37
00:01:58,460 --> 00:01:59,540
Now isn't the time.

38
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,300
- This is important.
- I need to see him.

39
00:02:01,580 --> 00:02:03,180
It's important to all of us.

40
00:02:03,580 --> 00:02:04,020
Yiyi.

41
00:02:04,660 --> 00:02:04,980
Yiyi.

42
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:05,380
Don't move.

43
00:02:05,900 --> 00:02:06,780
Mei Yuhe, what are you doing?

44
00:02:06,820 --> 00:02:07,660
Put down that hairpin!

45
00:02:07,740 --> 00:02:08,100
Miss Mei.

46
00:02:08,100 --> 00:02:08,620
Put it down!

47
00:02:08,700 --> 00:02:09,420
Answer me.

48
00:02:09,860 --> 00:02:11,980
Did Xiaozhu borrow money
from loan sharks for you?

49
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:13,780
Are you the older friend she mentioned?

50
00:02:15,220 --> 00:02:15,780
Yiyi.

51
00:02:16,580 --> 00:02:17,180
Yiyi.

52
00:02:18,220 --> 00:02:18,940
What's wrong, Yiyi?

53
00:02:20,380 --> 00:02:21,180
Are you all right, Yiyi?

54
00:02:22,020 --> 00:02:22,540
Yiyi.

55
00:02:22,740 --> 00:02:24,620
Didn't you say
you didn't know Mei Xiaozhu?

56
00:02:25,010 --> 00:02:26,180
Why did you lie?

57
00:02:27,140 --> 00:02:27,960
(Student ID: Mei Xiaozhu)
I don't know her.

58
00:02:28,180 --> 00:02:29,420
How could you not know her?

59
00:02:30,180 --> 00:02:32,500
I heard she did very well at your school

60
00:02:32,820 --> 00:02:33,940
and even received a scholarship.

61
00:02:33,940 --> 00:02:34,620
Isn't that right?

62
00:02:34,620 --> 00:02:35,420
What do you mean?

63
00:02:36,020 --> 00:02:37,460
You think my grades aren't good enough?

64
00:02:37,820 --> 00:02:39,180
You think paying for my education
is a waste of money?

65
00:02:39,380 --> 00:02:41,020
Can't you speak to me properly?

66
00:02:41,020 --> 00:02:41,820
No.

67
00:02:49,820 --> 00:02:51,100
Who's lying?

68
00:02:52,820 --> 00:02:54,700
Does going to the same school mean
I have to know her?

69
00:02:55,260 --> 00:02:56,420
I remember now.

70
00:02:57,020 --> 00:02:58,740
You went out with Xiaozhu before.

71
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:00,580
You even came to my house
to wait for her.

72
00:03:00,980 --> 00:03:02,140
You two were friends.

73
00:03:02,180 --> 00:03:02,860
No.

74
00:03:02,860 --> 00:03:04,020
She wasn't my friend!

75
00:03:04,260 --> 00:03:05,260
Who would be friends with her?

76
00:03:05,260 --> 00:03:06,220
She's a traitor!

77
00:03:06,420 --> 00:03:07,580
Even saying another word to her,

78
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:08,220
just one more sentence,

79
00:03:08,220 --> 00:03:09,140
would make me feel filthy.

80
00:03:09,220 --> 00:03:10,340
It's disgusting!

81
00:03:10,980 --> 00:03:12,380
Since you hate her so much,

82
00:03:12,620 --> 00:03:14,460
tell me everything you know.

83
00:03:14,620 --> 00:03:15,820
How exactly did Xiaozhu die?

84
00:03:15,820 --> 00:03:16,700
Tell me!

85
00:03:18,780 --> 00:03:19,340
Yiyi.

86
00:03:23,340 --> 00:03:24,780
She got what she deserved.

87
00:03:29,020 --> 00:03:29,820
Yiyi.

88
00:03:29,820 --> 00:03:30,540
You're scaring me, Yiyi.

89
00:03:33,260 --> 00:03:35,060
I was the one who liked Mengde first.

90
00:03:35,060 --> 00:03:36,220
What right did she have
to steal him from me?

91
00:03:36,420 --> 00:03:37,580
What right did she have?

92
00:03:37,580 --> 00:03:38,460
What right?

93
00:03:38,620 --> 00:03:39,420
Lv Mengde?

94
00:03:39,420 --> 00:03:40,380
You mean Lv Mengde?

95
00:03:40,940 --> 00:03:42,060
That scheming woman.

96
00:03:42,340 --> 00:03:43,980
On Mengde's birthday,

97
00:03:43,980 --> 00:03:45,980
she even cut her hair short,
just the way he liked it!

98
00:03:47,860 --> 00:03:49,900
Now Mei Xiaozhu is dead.

99
00:03:50,780 --> 00:03:51,380
Next

100
00:03:52,860 --> 00:03:54,380
will be Lisa.

101
00:03:55,140 --> 00:03:55,940
Lisa?

102
00:03:57,820 --> 00:03:58,660
Yiyi.

103
00:04:00,300 --> 00:04:01,100
Yiyi.

104
00:04:01,620 --> 00:04:02,820
Let go! Let go of me!

105
00:04:02,820 --> 00:04:03,380
Go away!

106
00:04:03,380 --> 00:04:04,180
All of you, go away!

107
00:04:04,180 --> 00:04:05,340
Get away from me! Go away!

108
00:04:05,860 --> 00:04:06,580
Go away!

109
00:04:06,820 --> 00:04:07,540
Just look at her!

110
00:04:07,540 --> 00:04:09,380
Look what you've done to her!

111
00:04:09,420 --> 00:04:10,700
Get out of here!

112
00:04:23,620 --> 00:04:25,700
Did you drink that wine at Kaimeili too?

113
00:04:30,220 --> 00:04:30,780
Zhao.

114
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:32,820
Zhao, save me. Zhao.

115
00:04:36,420 --> 00:04:37,020
Ding Yiyi.

116
00:04:37,020 --> 00:04:38,220
Tell me the truth.

117
00:04:40,020 --> 00:04:41,740
Did you drink coca wine too?

118
00:04:44,820 --> 00:04:46,060
Ding Yiyi, look at me. Yiyi.

119
00:04:46,980 --> 00:04:47,580
Tell me the truth.

120
00:04:47,580 --> 00:04:48,660
Did you drink coca wine?

121
00:04:48,660 --> 00:04:49,420
Did you?

122
00:04:49,460 --> 00:04:50,420
Can't you understand what I'm saying?

123
00:04:50,420 --> 00:04:51,780
Get out of here now.

124
00:04:53,620 --> 00:04:54,580
Look at me.

125
00:04:55,140 --> 00:04:56,420
Did you drink coca wine?

126
00:04:58,380 --> 00:04:59,220
Tell me the truth.

127
00:04:59,220 --> 00:05:00,740
Did you drink coca wine?

128
00:05:00,740 --> 00:05:01,580
Yes, I did!

129
00:05:01,580 --> 00:05:02,300
So what?

130
00:05:06,820 --> 00:05:07,740
Come with me to the hospital.

131
00:05:08,740 --> 00:05:09,940
You're coming to the hospital
with me now.

132
00:05:10,860 --> 00:05:12,380
Yiyi, come to the hospital with me.

133
00:05:12,940 --> 00:05:13,860
Come with me.

134
00:05:13,860 --> 00:05:14,420
Yiyi.

135
00:05:14,420 --> 00:05:15,860
- You have to overcome your addiction.
- I'm not going.

136
00:05:15,860 --> 00:05:16,900
I'm not going.

137
00:05:16,940 --> 00:05:17,660
Ding Zhao.

138
00:05:17,740 --> 00:05:18,540
Ding Zhao, why...

139
00:05:18,780 --> 00:05:19,260
Why are you...

140
00:05:19,260 --> 00:05:20,340
What are you trying to do?

141
00:05:20,540 --> 00:05:22,060
Are you trying to drive me crazy?

142
00:05:22,180 --> 00:05:23,700
Do you know what she's doing?

143
00:05:24,420 --> 00:05:25,420
She's taking drugs!

144
00:05:25,820 --> 00:05:27,060
Just like my mother!

145
00:05:35,460 --> 00:05:35,980
Yiyi.

146
00:05:42,340 --> 00:05:43,900
I'm begging you, Yiyi.

147
00:05:45,020 --> 00:05:46,380
Please come to the hospital with me.

148
00:05:47,660 --> 00:05:48,940
Get help for your addiction.

149
00:05:50,780 --> 00:05:51,980
After that, whatever you choose to do,

150
00:05:51,980 --> 00:05:53,420
I won't interfere anymore.

151
00:06:33,820 --> 00:06:34,740
You haven't eaten.

152
00:06:35,540 --> 00:06:36,540
Don't faint.

153
00:06:49,300 --> 00:06:50,020
I'm not

154
00:06:50,020 --> 00:06:52,100
a little girl you can comfort
with candy anymore.

155
00:06:55,020 --> 00:06:56,940
And you're not the brother
you used to be.

156
00:06:58,820 --> 00:07:00,060
We've both changed.

157
00:07:01,780 --> 00:07:03,140
You have your own life.

158
00:07:03,220 --> 00:07:04,340
And I have mine.

159
00:07:08,260 --> 00:07:10,140
I want to find my own happiness.

160
00:07:10,220 --> 00:07:11,660
Lv Mengde isn't your happiness.

161
00:07:11,940 --> 00:07:13,420
How do you know he isn't?

162
00:07:19,060 --> 00:07:19,860
His love

163
00:07:20,540 --> 00:07:22,340
is like soft velvet.

164
00:07:23,580 --> 00:07:24,620
So gentle

165
00:07:25,380 --> 00:07:26,460
and so warm.

166
00:07:28,420 --> 00:07:30,140
Every day I spend with him

167
00:07:30,780 --> 00:07:32,980
feels like living in a dream.

168
00:07:33,860 --> 00:07:35,300
Only when I love him

169
00:07:36,620 --> 00:07:38,740
do I truly feel alive.

170
00:07:39,980 --> 00:07:41,540
Do you know what that feels like?

171
00:07:42,380 --> 00:07:44,100
Do you even know what love is?

172
00:07:48,020 --> 00:07:48,820
Then again,

173
00:07:50,740 --> 00:07:52,020
with a family like ours

174
00:07:52,020 --> 00:07:53,140
and the way we grew up,

175
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:55,540
how could we know what love is?

176
00:08:05,220 --> 00:08:05,980
I'm sorry.

177
00:08:09,260 --> 00:08:10,180
Does it still hurt?

178
00:08:14,180 --> 00:08:14,740
Zhao.

179
00:08:16,500 --> 00:08:17,580
Just this once,

180
00:08:19,140 --> 00:08:21,340
let me pursue my own happiness.

181
00:08:23,780 --> 00:08:25,420
If it were true happiness,

182
00:08:26,940 --> 00:08:28,580
of course I'd want you to have it.

183
00:08:29,460 --> 00:08:30,620
But it isn't.

184
00:08:32,980 --> 00:08:33,740
How can you know

185
00:08:33,740 --> 00:08:34,940
without giving it a try?

186
00:09:09,860 --> 00:09:11,260
Yiyi!

187
00:09:11,420 --> 00:09:12,100
Make way!

188
00:09:12,220 --> 00:09:13,060
Make way!

189
00:09:13,100 --> 00:09:13,620
Yiyi!

190
00:09:14,100 --> 00:09:14,700
Yiyi!

191
00:09:14,740 --> 00:09:15,900
Move! Make way!

192
00:09:15,900 --> 00:09:16,660
Yiyi!

193
00:09:17,020 --> 00:09:18,580
Make way!

194
00:09:19,020 --> 00:09:19,620
Move!

195
00:09:19,900 --> 00:09:20,700
Yiyi!

196
00:09:22,100 --> 00:09:23,100
Yiyi!

197
00:09:23,620 --> 00:09:24,580
Yiyi!

198
00:09:28,180 --> 00:09:29,060
Yiyi!

199
00:09:30,260 --> 00:09:31,140
Yiyi!

200
00:09:32,620 --> 00:09:33,500
Yiyi!

201
00:09:38,860 --> 00:09:39,940
Yiyi!

202
00:09:40,340 --> 00:09:41,500
Yiyi!

203
00:09:45,500 --> 00:09:46,220
Yan Qing.

204
00:09:55,140 --> 00:09:55,740
Yan Qing.

205
00:10:11,300 --> 00:10:12,140
Our great reporter Yan!

206
00:10:12,940 --> 00:10:13,740
Who's there?

207
00:10:14,220 --> 00:10:14,780
It's me.

208
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:16,820
Not again.

209
00:10:16,980 --> 00:10:17,660
What is it?

210
00:10:19,460 --> 00:10:22,020
Are you still in touch with Lisa?

211
00:10:22,140 --> 00:10:23,180
Where is she living now?

212
00:10:24,340 --> 00:10:25,260
What Lisa?

213
00:10:27,140 --> 00:10:28,380
Get up, Yan Qing.

214
00:10:28,820 --> 00:10:31,300
Get up. Stop fooling around!

215
00:10:58,380 --> 00:11:00,420
It's a little embarrassing to admit,

216
00:11:00,820 --> 00:11:03,780
but I don't even have a decent outfit
for the competition.

217
00:11:04,340 --> 00:11:06,460
Yan Qing said you're
an excellent tailor,

218
00:11:07,180 --> 00:11:09,620
so I thought I'd ask you for help.

219
00:11:09,620 --> 00:11:10,500
Don't say that.

220
00:11:10,980 --> 00:11:12,780
Making a dress for a future singing star

221
00:11:12,780 --> 00:11:13,820
would be my honor.

222
00:11:15,820 --> 00:11:17,580
You're such a talented dressmaker,
Miss Mei.

223
00:11:17,820 --> 00:11:19,020
It's because you're beautiful.

224
00:11:19,380 --> 00:11:21,260
The dress only brings out your beauty.

225
00:11:21,620 --> 00:11:22,500
Right, Yan Qing?

226
00:11:22,900 --> 00:11:23,700
Right.

227
00:11:24,420 --> 00:11:25,780
Let me take a picture of you two.

228
00:11:27,820 --> 00:11:28,660
May I?

229
00:11:29,260 --> 00:11:30,460
Of course.

230
00:11:30,540 --> 00:11:31,380
Get your camera out.

231
00:11:31,380 --> 00:11:32,020
Hey.

232
00:11:37,420 --> 00:11:38,220
Look this way.

233
00:11:39,260 --> 00:11:41,380
Three, two, one.

234
00:11:55,180 --> 00:11:57,980
You even made the qipao
in this photograph.

235
00:11:58,620 --> 00:11:59,500
Sober now?

236
00:11:59,620 --> 00:12:00,420
Not yet.

237
00:12:04,420 --> 00:12:05,860
Why are you asking about Lisa?

238
00:12:07,820 --> 00:12:10,180
I just happened to think of her.

239
00:12:11,420 --> 00:12:12,780
Are you still in touch with her?

240
00:12:14,660 --> 00:12:16,540
I'm hardly someone she'd keep
in touch with.

241
00:12:22,660 --> 00:12:24,180
But there was a report recently

242
00:12:24,820 --> 00:12:25,600
that she's getting married.

243
00:12:25,600 --> 00:12:26,580
(Kaimeili Singer Lisa May Retire
After Engagement to Mysterious Tycoon)

244
00:12:26,580 --> 00:12:27,540
Who's she marrying?

245
00:12:28,540 --> 00:12:29,620
Who else could it be?

246
00:12:30,580 --> 00:12:31,620
She's marrying into prestige

247
00:12:32,260 --> 00:12:33,420
and wealth.

248
00:12:34,980 --> 00:12:35,940
In this day and age,

249
00:12:36,220 --> 00:12:38,020
everyone wants to get rich,

250
00:12:38,460 --> 00:12:39,260
become famous,

251
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:41,100
and climb a little higher,

252
00:12:41,340 --> 00:12:42,300
then a little higher still,

253
00:12:43,020 --> 00:12:44,780
so that when the great wave
comes crashing down,

254
00:12:45,340 --> 00:12:46,540
they might have a ticket aboard a ship

255
00:12:47,060 --> 00:12:48,340
or something to cling to

256
00:12:48,340 --> 00:12:49,500
and survive.

257
00:12:50,060 --> 00:12:51,540
Unfortunately, I'm not capable enough.

258
00:12:53,420 --> 00:12:55,500
I couldn't be someone she could rely on,

259
00:12:56,980 --> 00:12:58,620
nor could I offer her that ticket.

260
00:13:01,980 --> 00:13:02,780
Yan Qing.

261
00:13:03,940 --> 00:13:04,740
Yuhe.

262
00:13:05,220 --> 00:13:06,940
You know plenty of wealthy ladies.

263
00:13:07,340 --> 00:13:09,140
Could you find me a ticket too?

264
00:13:16,380 --> 00:13:17,820
Actually, there's one readily available.

265
00:13:18,260 --> 00:13:19,060
Who?

266
00:13:19,580 --> 00:13:22,060
The Kuang family's eldest daughter,
Kuang Yinyue.

267
00:13:24,140 --> 00:13:24,940
The Kuang family?

268
00:13:26,140 --> 00:13:27,540
That would be quite a ticket.

269
00:13:28,820 --> 00:13:30,780
Her husband, who married
into the family, just died.

270
00:13:31,220 --> 00:13:33,780
Yes, I saw the obituary a while ago.

271
00:13:33,780 --> 00:13:34,820
It said he died of illness.

272
00:13:36,140 --> 00:13:38,660
You're not suggesting I marry
into her family, are you?

273
00:13:39,140 --> 00:13:39,940
He didn't die of illness.

274
00:13:41,180 --> 00:13:43,380
He was murdered at a charity banquet

275
00:13:43,620 --> 00:13:44,460
at the Paris Hotel.

276
00:13:45,860 --> 00:13:47,020
The Paris Hotel?

277
00:13:48,020 --> 00:13:48,700
But I seem to remember

278
00:13:48,700 --> 00:13:50,540
the victim was a young woman.

279
00:13:51,220 --> 00:13:52,020
I think...

280
00:13:52,660 --> 00:13:54,540
I think she had
the same last name as you.

281
00:13:59,820 --> 00:14:00,660
It was Xiaozhu.

282
00:14:01,300 --> 00:14:02,100
Xiaozhu?

283
00:14:03,700 --> 00:14:05,420
She was involved
in Dong Zhenglun's death?

284
00:14:07,940 --> 00:14:09,100
Xiaozhu killed him.

285
00:14:09,140 --> 00:14:09,940
How could that be?

286
00:14:10,140 --> 00:14:11,220
That's what I want to know.

287
00:14:12,540 --> 00:14:13,580
How could this have happened?

288
00:14:19,020 --> 00:14:20,100
I'd been thinking

289
00:14:20,860 --> 00:14:22,860
of taking a roll of photographs
of you and Xiaozhu

290
00:14:23,740 --> 00:14:25,780
as a graduation gift for her next year.

291
00:14:26,860 --> 00:14:28,500
I never imagined I'd only use
half the roll.

292
00:14:29,420 --> 00:14:30,420
The remaining half

293
00:14:31,940 --> 00:14:33,300
will never be used.

294
00:14:37,060 --> 00:14:38,260
Will you help me?

295
00:14:38,680 --> 00:14:40,160
Of course I'll help you.

296
00:14:40,980 --> 00:14:42,220
What does the Kuang family have to say?

297
00:14:45,940 --> 00:14:47,100
As for Dong Zhenglun's death,

298
00:14:48,060 --> 00:14:49,140
no matter how much
they try to cover it up,

299
00:14:49,220 --> 00:14:50,660
people are bound to talk.

300
00:14:51,780 --> 00:14:54,660
Kuang Yinyue hates anyone
who embarrasses her.

301
00:14:55,060 --> 00:14:56,540
She'll definitely keep investigating.

302
00:14:56,580 --> 00:14:57,900
What do you need me to do?

303
00:14:58,060 --> 00:14:58,980
Find Lisa.

304
00:14:59,540 --> 00:15:00,460
Is she involved?

305
00:15:02,020 --> 00:15:03,420
It's connected to Kaimeili.

306
00:15:05,220 --> 00:15:06,980
Why didn't you stop

307
00:15:07,580 --> 00:15:08,820
Ding Zhao and Mei Yuhe
from coming last night?

308
00:15:09,420 --> 00:15:10,700
We're running a business.

309
00:15:10,980 --> 00:15:12,140
Everyone who comes is a customer.

310
00:15:12,660 --> 00:15:14,100
How could I turn them away?

311
00:15:18,220 --> 00:15:19,020
Besides,

312
00:15:19,820 --> 00:15:22,140
you asked a loan shark
to investigate that woman.

313
00:15:22,820 --> 00:15:24,260
Surely you should trust
someone you've chosen

314
00:15:24,820 --> 00:15:25,900
or not use them at all.

315
00:15:26,260 --> 00:15:27,260
What's that supposed to mean?

316
00:15:27,420 --> 00:15:28,220
Are you mocking me?

317
00:15:28,420 --> 00:15:29,820
He asked me to warn you

318
00:15:30,460 --> 00:15:31,660
not to take things too far.

319
00:15:31,660 --> 00:15:32,700
Too far?

320
00:15:32,820 --> 00:15:34,460
Wasn't he the one
who forced me to find my sister?

321
00:15:34,460 --> 00:15:35,460
You know perfectly well

322
00:15:36,140 --> 00:15:37,340
why he wants her found.

323
00:15:49,140 --> 00:15:50,220
He's really angry this time?

324
00:15:50,460 --> 00:15:51,460
What else did he say?

325
00:15:51,620 --> 00:15:53,620
Clean up your own mess

326
00:15:54,420 --> 00:15:55,900
and don't ruin his plans.

327
00:15:57,340 --> 00:15:58,060
Feng.

328
00:15:58,180 --> 00:15:58,900
I'm sorry.

329
00:15:59,020 --> 00:16:00,300
I'm sorry, Feng.

330
00:16:00,300 --> 00:16:01,300
Don't be angry with me.

331
00:16:01,980 --> 00:16:02,580
All right?

332
00:16:07,540 --> 00:16:08,580
Please don't be angry anymore.

333
00:16:08,700 --> 00:16:11,220
You promised me. You promised

334
00:16:11,540 --> 00:16:13,660
you'd treat me well
for the rest of my life, right?

335
00:16:20,060 --> 00:16:20,820
Feng.

336
00:16:21,820 --> 00:16:23,220
I'm sorry. Please don't be angry.

337
00:16:40,540 --> 00:16:41,340
Well?

338
00:16:42,020 --> 00:16:43,340
Have you found the person I asked for?

339
00:16:43,780 --> 00:16:44,740
Where's my sister?

340
00:16:44,860 --> 00:16:46,380
I'm the one asking you for someone now,

341
00:16:47,260 --> 00:16:48,700
not the other way around.

342
00:16:55,580 --> 00:16:56,380
Tell me!

343
00:16:56,420 --> 00:16:57,460
Where's Yiyi?

344
00:16:57,460 --> 00:16:58,820
What? Are you going to kill me?

345
00:16:58,820 --> 00:16:59,580
My dear future brother-in-law.

346
00:16:59,820 --> 00:17:00,260
If I die,

347
00:17:00,260 --> 00:17:01,260
what will your sister do?

348
00:17:01,460 --> 00:17:02,260
Die for love?

349
00:17:02,260 --> 00:17:03,180
Where is Ding Yiyi?

350
00:17:03,180 --> 00:17:04,620
Hand Yiyi over!

351
00:17:05,180 --> 00:17:06,420
Ding Yiyi has never been here.

352
00:17:06,420 --> 00:17:07,540
I swear to heaven.

353
00:17:15,420 --> 00:17:16,380
That's what you get for pushing me.

354
00:17:16,380 --> 00:17:17,740
For going against me!

355
00:17:22,980 --> 00:17:23,780
Enough!

356
00:17:27,460 --> 00:17:28,420
If you're that upset,

357
00:17:28,740 --> 00:17:30,500
I can shoot him for you.

358
00:17:30,860 --> 00:17:32,380
Why go to all this trouble?

359
00:17:32,780 --> 00:17:34,060
Just shoot him?

360
00:17:35,620 --> 00:17:36,820
Where's the fun in that?

361
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:41,440
♪And watch the lights
come on one by one♪

362
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:44,840
♪Like blades cutting
through the radiance♪

363
00:17:45,480 --> 00:17:48,320
♪You may treat me as dust
beneath your feet♪

364
00:17:48,320 --> 00:17:50,240
♪Or wipe me away like ashes♪

365
00:17:50,240 --> 00:17:51,800
♪Leaving a cold ending♪

366
00:17:51,800 --> 00:17:53,760
♪But I refuse to fall♪

367
00:17:53,760 --> 00:17:58,680
♪I refuse to become a shadow
fading beneath the lights♪

368
00:17:58,800 --> 00:18:01,240
♪I refuse to dissolve into♪

369
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:05,320
♪The lifeless light of the past♪

370
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:08,480
♪I want sharpness at my fingertips♪

371
00:18:08,520 --> 00:18:11,320
♪And steps that avoid
the traps among the thorns♪

372
00:18:12,040 --> 00:18:14,920
♪At dawn, I will look
straight into your eyes♪

373
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:18,120
♪My gaze clear, illuminating the dawn♪

374
00:18:19,600 --> 00:18:22,360
♪Those who have hurt me♪

375
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:25,600
♪I choose to pierce through♪

376
00:18:27,200 --> 00:18:28,680
♪To tear apart♪

377
00:18:28,800 --> 00:18:34,680
♪To ignite a sacred flame♪

378
00:18:36,360 --> 00:18:38,480
♪I do not pray to the gods♪

379
00:18:38,480 --> 00:18:41,400
♪Nor bow to power♪

380
00:18:41,400 --> 00:18:43,680
♪I will no longer play the tragic lead♪

381
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:49,400
♪I will stand and carve
the path of my own fate♪
